Import project modules with the `@/` path alias, which maps to `src/` (e.g. `@/components/Foo` == `src/components/Foo`), instead of deep relative paths like `../../components/Foo`.

This template uses Vite 8. `resolve.tsconfigPaths: true` is a valid built-in Vite option. Preserve it for the `@/` alias; do not claim it is invalid or add the `vite-tsconfig-paths` plugin.

Author decks through the `deck-api` edge function (Postgres). Before authoring you MUST: (1) invoke the bolt-database skill, (2) apply `supabase/migrations/create_deck_tables.sql` with mcp__supabase__apply_migration, (3) deploy `supabase/functions/deck-api` with mcp__supabase__deploy_edge_function, (4) confirm GET $VITE_SUPABASE_URL/functions/v1/deck-api/state returns 200. Follow `.bolt/skills/slides/SKILL.md`.
